<title>UK: U.S. stocks not trading in London on Monday.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks not trading in London on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were not trading in London on Monday as U.S. markets will be closed today for the Labor Day holiday.</p>
<p>&quot;I have not seen anything in dollar-denominated stocks cross my screen,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>U.S. markets will reopen for business on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
